":"ingredient-cuttlefish"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cuttlefish"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":5,"groups":[["Andorran cuisine","cuisine/andorran-cuisine",[["Arròs negre","dish/arros-negre"]]],["Catalan cuisine","cuisine/catalan-cuisine",[["Arròs negre","dish/arros-negre"]]],["Chinese cuisine","cuisine/chinese-cuisine",[["Orange cuttlefish","dish/orange-cuttlefish"]]],["Korean Chinese cuisine","cuisine/korean-chinese-cuisine",[["Ulmyeon","dish/ulmyeon"]]],["Valencian cuisine","cuisine/valencian-cuisine",[["Arròs negre","dish/arros-negre"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Squid as food","ingredient/squid-as-food"],["Cephalopod ink","ingredient/cephalopod-ink"],["Cubanelle","ingredient/cubanelle"],["Rice","ingredient/rice"],["Sepiida","ingredient/sepiida"],["Agaricus bisporus","ingredient/agaricus-bisporus"],["Broth","ingredient/broth"],["Carrot","ingredient/carrot"],["Cornstarch","ingredient/cornstarch"],["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Noodle","ingredient/noodle"],["Noodles","ingredient/noodles"],["Sea cucumber","ingredient/sea-cucumber"],["Shiitake","ingredient/shiitake"],["Shrimp","ingredient/shrimp"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/6/65/Sepia_com%C3%BAn_%28Sepia_officinalis%29%2C_Parque_natural_de_la_Arr%C3%A1bida%2C_Portugal%2C_2020-07-21%2C_DD_62.jpg/500px-Sepia_com%C3%BAn_%28Sepia_officinalis%29%2C_Parque_natural_de_la_Arr%C3%A1bida%2C_Portugal%2C_2020-07-21%2C_DD_62.jpg","w":500,"h":333,"by":"Diego Delso","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sepia_com%C3%BAn_(Sepia_officinalis)%2C_Parque_natural_de_la_Arr%C3%A1bida%2C_Portugal%2C_2020-07-21%2C_DD_62.jpg"}},"dish/chimichanga":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/chimichanga","n":"Chimichanga","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish found in 2 cuisines","dot":"#94bd5c","intro":[["A chimichanga is a deep-fried burrito that is common in Southwestern U.S. cuisine. The dish is typically prepared by filling a flour tortilla with various ingredients, most commonly rice, cheese, beans, and a meat, such as machaca (chopped or shredded meat), carne adobada (marinated meat), carne seca (dried beef), or shredded chicken, and folding it into a rectangular package. It is then deep-fried, and can be accompanied by salsa, guacamole, or sour cream."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-chimichanga"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chimichanga"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine"],["Mexican cuisine","cuisine/mexican-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":9,"links":[["Adobada","ingredient/adobada"],["Bean","ingredient/bean"],["Cheese","ingredient/cheese"],["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"],["Flour tortilla","ingredient/flour-tortilla"],["Jalapeño","ingredient/jalapeno"],["Machaca","ingredient/machaca"],["Rice","ingredient/rice"],["Tortilla","ingredient/tortilla"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Mexico in My Kitchen","ref":"site/mexicoinmykitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"mexicoinmykitchen.com","note":"Mely Martínez's long-running blog of Mexican home-style recipes.","url":"https://www.mexicoinmykitchen.com/","suggested":true},{"name":"Pati Jinich","ref":"site/patijinich-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"patijinich.com","note":"Recipe archive from the Mexican-born chef and host of the PBS series Pati's Mexican Table.","url":"https://patijinich.com/recipes/","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from American cuisine","links":[["5-8 Club","dish/5-8-club"],["Altabira City Tavern","dish/altabira-city-tavern"],["Angel food cake","dish/angel-food-cake"],["Applebee's","dish/applebee-s"],["Arby's","dish/arby-s"],["Arnold's Bar and Grill","dish/arnold-s-bar-and-grill"],["Banana bread","dish/banana-bread"],["Banana pudding","dish/banana-pudding"],["Barbecue sauce","dish/barbecue-sauce"],["Be Our Guest Restaurant","dish/be-our-guest-