","dish/union-square-cafe"],["Woodberry Kitchen","dish/woodberry-kitchen"]]}]},"ingredient/endive":{"t":"ingredient","r":"ingredient/endive","n":"Endive","c":"#c9b8dd","crumb":[["Ingredients","ingredients"]],"sub":"Ingredient in 1 dish across 1 cuisine","intro":[["Endive () is a leaf vegetable belonging to the genus Cichorium, which includes several similar bitter-leafed vegetables. Species include Cichorium endivia (also called endive), Cichorium pumilum (also called wild endive), and Cichorium intybus (also called chicory). Chicory includes types such as radicchio, puntarelle, and Belgian endive."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-endive"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endive"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":1,"groups":[["Dutch cuisine","cuisine/dutch-cuisine",[["Stamppot","dish/stamppot"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Broccoli","ingredient/broccoli"],["Onion","ingredient/onion"],["Potato","ingredient/potato"],["Vegetables","ingredient/vegetables"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/0/00/Cichorium_endivia_-_Botanischer_Garten_Mainz_IMG_5453.JPG/500px-Cichorium_endivia_-_Botanischer_Garten_Mainz_IMG_5453.JPG","w":500,"h":333,"by":"Oceancetaceen - Alice Chodura","lic":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cichorium_endivia_-_Botanischer_Garten_Mainz_IMG_5453.JPG"}},"dish/sukiyabashi-jiro":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/sukiyabashi-jiro","n":"Sukiyabashi Jiro","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Japanese cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Sukiyabashi Jiro is a sushi restaurant in Ginza, Chūō, Tokyo, owned by Jiro Ono. Ono previously operated as the head chef, but stepped aside in favor of his son Yoshikazu Ono in 2023 due to ill health."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-sukiyabashi-jiro"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sukiyabashi_J